## Initial Q&A
### What was the total cumulative number of confirmed COVID-19 deaths in the United States as of October 30, 2020, according to Johns Hopkins University or another authoritative tracker?
Answer: According to Johns Hopkins University, as reported on October 30, 2020, the total cumulative number of confirmed COVID-19 deaths in the United States was 229,686.

Source URL: https://www.cnn.com/world/live-news/coronavirus-pandemic-10-30-20-intl/index.html

